# Per-path PR review routing.
#
# Issue assignment is NOT controlled by this file. It is handled
# separately by the auto-issue composite action's inline target -> @user
# map in .github/actions/fuzz-auto-issue/action.yml.
#
# Specific handles are TBD-marked and must be replaced with real GitHub
# usernames before merging. CODEOWNERS silently ignores unresolvable
# handles, so a stale TBD-* entry will not block PR creation -- it just
# fails to request a review.

/crates/tsoracle-driver-file/   @TBD-driver-file-owner
/crates/tsoracle-proto/         @TBD-proto-owner
/fuzz/                          @TBD-fuzz-steward
/.github/workflows/fuzz-*.yml   @TBD-fuzz-steward
/.github/actions/fuzz-*/        @TBD-fuzz-steward
